Feature: Editing

  Background:
    Given I Visit "/"
    And I Add "buy some cheese"
    And I Add "feed the cat"
    And I Add "book a doctors appointment"

  Scenario: Other controls hide while editing
    When I Double-click the Todo "feed the cat"
    Then the Checkbox "Toggle Todo" Within the Todo "feed the cat" should be Hidden
    And the Text "feed the cat" should be Hidden

  Scenario: Saving on blur
    When I Double-click the Todo "feed the cat"
    And I Fill the Editor with "buy some sausages"
    And I Click the Heading "todos"
    Then I should See "buy some sausages"
    But I should Not See "feed the cat"

  Scenario: Trimming what's entered
    When I Double-click the Todo "feed the cat"
    And I Fill the Editor with "    buy some sausages    "
    And I Press "Enter" on the Editor
    Then I should See the Text "buy some sausages"

  Scenario: An empty todo is removed
    When I Double-click the Todo "feed the cat"
    And I Clear the Editor
    And I Press "Enter" on the Editor
    Then I should Not See "feed the cat"
    And I should See "2 items left"

  Scenario: Escape cancels
    When I Double-click the Todo "feed the cat"
    And I Fill the Editor with "buy some sausages"
    And I Press "Escape" on the Editor
    Then I should See "feed the cat"
    But I should Not See "buy some sausages"
